<item>
<title>The Holy Fool</title>
<link>https://www.spreaker.com/episode/the-holy-fool--70000003</link>
<description><![CDATA[Paul called himself a fool for Christ, and the Church has had a few who took him literally. The Jesters meet the holy fools of the East, who walked barefoot through winter and threw stones at the houses of the respectable, and ask what a life of deliberate foolishness says to a Church that wants very badly to be taken seriously.<br /><br /><a href="https://jestersprivilegepodcast.com/fools" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Visit the Fools' Gallery.</a>]]></description>
