<item>
<title>Celebrity Pastors</title>
<link>https://www.spreaker.com/episode/celebrity-pastors--70000002</link>
<description><![CDATA[Every court needs a Fool, and every age has its celebrity pastors. In our first Episode, the Jesters ask why the Church keeps building platforms for preachers, what happens to a man when the crowd gets big, and whether laughter might be one of the few things that keeps a pastor honest. Dan tells a story about a green room, Aaron admits to a podcast he still listens to, and Michael explains why a king kept someone around whose job was to tell him the truth.<br /><br /><a href="https://www.instagram.com/jestersprivilege/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Follow us on Instagram.</a><br /><br /><a href="https://jestersprivilegepodcast.com/submit" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Send us a Question, a Confession, or a Topic idea.</a>]]></description>
